      "why": "Describes each brand photo (subjects, mood, colours, what posts it suits). Reading images is a Flash-class job: it needs no frontier reasoning and runs once per image, so cost matters. The anchored family keeps out -lite, -tts, -image, -live and the moving gemini-flash-latest alias.",
      "source": "https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/models",
      "read_on": "2026-10-27"
    }
